'''Monnoks''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] biped<ref name="How Not to" /> [[species]] that were feared by many, including the [[desert]] nomads of [[Socorro]]. Although they looked primitive, they used spears, and were excellent [[Hunting|hunters]]<ref name="Jedi Challenges" /> on their homeworld Socorro. Their appearance was used for one of the [[Hologram|holographic]] pieces in the game [[dejarik]],<ref name="Absolutely Everything You Need to Know">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> which had [[Color|red]] and yellow skin, black [[eye]]s, and carried a [[staff]].<ref name="A New Hope" />

